---
title: "functionCall (LegionBouncer)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: onlyRoles(BROADCASTER_ROLE)
    q_guard --> q_checkRole: caller has BROADCASTER_ROLE?
    q_checkRole --> q_revert: unauthorized - revert
    q_checkRole --> q_execute: target.call(data)
    q_execute --> q_checkResult: call success?
    q_checkResult --> q_revertCall: call failed - revert with returndata
    q_checkResult --> q_return: return result
    q_return --> [*]: return
    q_revert --> [*]: revert
    q_revertCall --> [*]: revert

    note right of q_guard
        INV-001: Only BROADCASTER_ROLE (AWS Broadcaster Wallet) can execute
        INV-002: Owner (Legion admin) manages role grants
    end note

    note right of q_execute
        INV-003: Arbitrary external call to any target with any calldata
        INV-004: Used by Legion backend to call sale/distribution contract admin functions
    end note
